<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japan stock via 11 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japan stock via 11 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 11 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Wednesday showed a net selling stance of 12.6 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors' sell orders totalled 28.9 million shares while buy orders amounted to 16.3 million shares.</p>
